    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Replaces value of FE-integratiion-point property &apos;a&apos; with node property value &apos;b&apos;,
testing (for the case where all the node values are the same) whether the FE interpolation returns the same value.
</verbatim></para>
<para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000150"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>(1) <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_integration_point_to_node_property_visitor" kindref="compound">IntegrationPointToNodePropertyVisitor</ref> is not extrapolating correctly (A) </para>
<para>(1) SKM: consider using the element specific method ExtrapolateIntegrationPointToNodeProperty for this task</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
    </detaileddescription>
